{"about_the_game":"Embark on an epic journey through mysterious terrains and dark jungles with <strong>&quot;Traces of the Unknown.&quot;</strong> In this exploration RPG, you take on the role of a fearless, unknown explorer whose burning desire to unravel the unknown leads to an adventure that transcends the limits of the village he calls home.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>key Features:</strong></h2></h2></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Fearless Exploration:</strong> </h2></h2>Immerse yourself in a complex world of whispering forests, wild creatures, and shadowy monsters. Explore hostile terrains, unravel intriguing dungeons, and discover hidden secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721850/extras/b0f08b22ce77c46b27adae32101c3d2f.poster.avif?t=1770766314\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721850/extras/b0f08b22ce77c46b27adae32101c3d2f.webm?t=1770766314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721850/extras/b0f08b22ce77c46b27adae32101c3d2f.mp4?t=1770766314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721850/extras/4bfdccafde272c0f13d98406655430e5.poster.avif?t=1770766314\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721850/extras/4bfdccafde272c0f13d98406655430e5.webm?t=1770766314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721850/extras/4bfdccafde272c0f13d98406655430e5.mp4?t=1770766314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721850/extras/3e46df74f65ac0d08f7b68a158d015d8.poster.avif?t=1770766314\" width=300 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721850/extras/3e46df74f65ac0d08f7b68a158d015d8.webm?t=1770766314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721850/extras/3e46df74f65ac0d08f7b68a158d015d8.mp4?t=1770766314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Deep Narrative:</strong> </h2></h2>Uncover a compelling story where the protagonist's courage is tested by the constant dance with the unknown. Face challenges, unravel ancient myths, and write your own story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Exceptional Art: </strong></h2></h2>Stunning visuals depict a vibrant yet dangerous world where every shadow hides secrets, and every ray of light reveals mysteries. The immersive atmosphere will take you to a realm of beauty and mystery.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Challenging Gameplay:</strong></h2></h2>Confront monsters with complex rationalities, solve intriguing puzzles, and collect ancient artifacts as you seek to unravel the secrets of creation. Every step is a dance with the unknown.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721850/extras/56feaa2006027b7801f693489a5b1128.poster.avif?t=1770766314\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721850/extras/56feaa2006027b7801f693489a5b1128.webm?t=1770766314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721850/extras/56feaa2006027b7801f693489a5